Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 09:36:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 226/254] feat(execution): bind the first vendor provider
 (AOCL/LPGEMM bf16+f32) into the U1 execution surface

- probe: sha256/version/arch/ABI/thread facts + structured unavailable
- register vendor:aocl-lpgemm-{bf16,f32} manifests (preconditions, numeric
  class, reduction order, library/artifact fingerprints, pack semantics)
- resolver/policy v2: auto_static, explicit vendor/required, declared
  fallback chain with max_steps and ErrorBudget-gated numeric downgrade
- ctypes execution with pinned BLIS threads; bf16 B pre-pack outside the
  timed region (reported), f32 pack inside (Q8 protocol)
- report v2: provider/library/artifact fingerprints, rejection reasons,
  pack/timing decomposition, fallback events, reconciliation flags
- U1 follow-ups: u1r1_D1 selected-vs-manifest reconciliation and F5
  provider-version-vs-outcome reconciliation
- tests: 26 new U2a regressions; U1 50-case suite updated for schema v2
